  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span>롷허<ruby>샬<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VVvhetcmrtc?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>落雨聲<rt>롷허샬ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>哪<rt>나ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>親像<rt>친ˉ츌-</rt></ruby><ruby>一條<rt>짇ᄃᆤ-</rt></ruby><ruby>歌<rt>과ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    loh-hor-siâ̰ nà chīn-chiṵ-jit-tiau-koâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>誰<rt>샹ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>知影<rt>재ˉ얄ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>斡頭<rt>왇ᄐᅷˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>敢<rt>갈ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>聽<rt>턀ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siáng jāi-yà̰ gùn oat-tháu m-kâ̰-thiâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>異鄉<rt>이형ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>一个<rt>짇에-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>起<rt>키ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>畏寒<rt>위ˋ괄ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    i-hiông’e goà jit-e-láng khî-wì-koá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>寂寞<rt>셕ˆ뻑ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>雨聲<rt>허샬ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>捶<rt>뒤-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>心肝<rt>심ˉ괄ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siôrk-bôrk’e hor-siâ̰ tui-gûn-sīm-koâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>孤單<rt>거ˉ돨ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>像<rt>츌-</rt></ruby><ruby>斷翼<rt>등싣ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>鳥隻<rt>ᄌᆤˆ쟣</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    láng kōr-toâ̰ chiṵ-tng-sît’e jiâu-jiah\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>飛<rt>붸ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>行<rt>걀ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>감<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>命<rt>먀ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    puē-boe-kiá̰ kâm-kông-si-gùn’e miā\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>故鄉<rt>거ˋ형ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>山<rt>솰ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>永遠<rt>옝완ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>徛<rt>캬-</rt></ruby><ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>햐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kòr-hiông’e soâ̰ yeng-oân-lông-khia-ti-hiâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>心情<rt>심ˉ쟐ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>只<rt>지ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>山<rt>솰ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>聽<rt>턀ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gùn’e sīm-jiá̰ jî-u-kông-hor-soâ̰ lai-thiâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>來到<rt>래ᄀᅷˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>故鄉<rt>거ˋ형ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>海岸<rt>해ˆ활ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lai-kàu-kòr-hiông’e hâi-hoā̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>景色<rt>곙ˆ셱</rt></ruby> <ruby>猶原<rt>유ˉ꽌-</rt></ruby><ruby>攏總<rt>렁ˆ정ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>變化<rt>볜ˋ화</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kiêng-siek yū-goan-lông-jòng bo-pièn-hoa\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>當初<rt>덩ˉ처ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>離開<rt>리퀴ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>為<rt>위-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥<rt>샬ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tōng-chôr li-khûi si-wi-sià̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>若<rt>나</rt></ruby><ruby>問<rt>믕ˉ</rt></ruby>’꾼 <ruby>꾼<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>心肝<rt>심ˉ괄ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>疼<rt>턀</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì na-mn̄g’gun gûn-sīm-koâ̰ tio-thia̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>若<rt>나</rt></ruby><ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>有孝<rt>유ˆᄒᅷˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>序大<rt>싀돠ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>免<rt>뼨ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>等<rt>단ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>好額<rt>호ˆ꺟ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì na-bêh-yû-hàu-si-toā m-biên-tân-hô-giâh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>世間<rt>세ˋ간ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>阿母<rt>아ˉ뿌ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>惜<rt>숗</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>囡仔<rt>긴ˆ아ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>上<rt>셩-</rt></ruby><ruby>好命<rt>호ˆ먀ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sè-kân u-ā-bù sioh’e kîn-à siong-hô-miā\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>通<rt>탕ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>等<rt>단ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>成功<rt>솅겅ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>接<rt>쟙ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>阿母<rt>아ˉ뿌ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>蹛<rt>돠</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    m-thāng-tân-sieng-kông bêh-lai-jiâp-ā-bù toa\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>阿母<rt>아ˉ뿌ˋ</rt></ruby>’앟 <ruby>已經<rt>이ˆ곙ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>햐<rt>ꞈ</rt><